# TCJastrowFitting

Project for TC-Jastrow fits. 

Tols for depth sweeps, plotting CCSD(T) energy errors, and compiling a small manuscript.

Project structure:

```
data/
figures/
tools/
main.tex
figures.tex
todo_list.tex
Makefile
```

---

## 1. Data Format (`data/heat_tc_energies.csv`)

Required columns:

* `project`
* `core` (`AE`, `eCEPP`, `ccECP`)
* `molecule`
* `basis`
* `ee/en/een_fixed` (bool, True if it is fixed)
* `ee/en/een_depth`
* `ee/en/een_cutoff`
* `spin_dependent_ee/en/een` (bool, True if it is spin dependent)
* `energy_au`
* `method` (`CCSD(T)`)

<!-- Currently ignored but required:

* `en_depth`, `een_depth`
* `spin_dependent_ee_cusp`, `spin_dependent_ee`, `spin_dependent_en`, `spin_dependent_een` -->

---

## 2. Plotting Tool (`tools/plot_depth_sweep.py`)

- Compute and plot:

  * ΔE_atom (ours – HEAT)
  * ΔE_form (ours – benchmark)
  * MAE across projects
  * One figure per `core`

  Run:

  ```
  python tools/plot_depth_sweep.py data/heat_tc_energies.csv --unit mHa
  ```

  Save figures:

  ```
  python tools/plot_depth_sweep.py data/heat_tc_energies.csv --unit mHa --save
  ```

  Generated files:

  ```
  figures/depth_sweep_AE.png
  figures/depth_sweep_eCEPP.png
  figures/depth_sweep_ccECP.png
  ```
- Plot free depth of AE and ECP
  ```
  python3 tools/plot_free_depths.py data/heat_tc_energies.csv -o figures/free_depths.png
  ```

---

## 3. Makefile

Targets:

```
make figures   # generate plots
make paper     # compile main.tex -> main.pdf
make clean     # remove LaTeX aux files
```

`make figures` runs:

```
/home/simula/miniconda3/bin/python tools/plot_depth_sweep.py data/heat_tc_energies.csv --unit mHa --save
```

---

## 4. VSCode

### launch.json

```
{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "configurations": [
    {
      "name": "Plot depth sweep",
      "type": "debugpy",
      "request": "launch",
      "program": "${workspaceFolder}/tools/plot_depth_sweep.py",
      "args": [
        "${workspaceFolder}/data/heat_tc_energies.csv",
        "--unit", "mHa",
        "--save"
      ],
      "console": "integratedTerminal",
      "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
    }
  ]
}
```

### tasks.json

```
{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    { "label": "Make Figures", "type": "shell", "command": "make figures" },
    { "label": "Build Manuscript", "type": "shell", "command": "make paper" }
  ]
}
```

---

## 5. Manuscript

Compile:

```
make paper
```

Figures included via:

```
\includegraphics{figures/depth_sweep_<core>.png}
```

